@startuml g4_6_5_architecture
title Fuel & Tire Analytics Architecture (G.4.6.5)

skinparam componentStyle uml2
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam packageBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam componentBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam componentBorderColor #0F172A

package "Authoritative Strategy Pipeline (G.4.5)" {
    [StrategyOptimizer\n(G.4.5.5)] as Optimizer
    [RankingResult\n(Authoritative Ranking)] as RankingRes
    [SimulationResult\n(4-Wheel & Lap Fuel Telemetry)] as SimRes
}

package "View-Model Transformation Layer (G.4.6.1)" {
    [StrategyDashboardAdapter] as Adapter
}

package "Presentation & Analytics UI Layer (G.4.6.5)" {
    [Selected Scenario ID\n(st.session_state)] as SessionState
    [prepare_fuel_tire_analytics_view_data] as ViewPrep
    
    package "Fuel & Tire Cockpit Presentation" {
        [Fuel Burn & Safety Margin Header] as FuelHeader
        [4-Corner Wheel Wear Breakdown\n(FL, FR, RL, RR Curves)] as CornerWearChart
        [Axle & Lateral Wear Balance] as WearBalanceVisual
        [Stint Degradation & Tire Life Table] as TireLifeTable
        [Engineering Alert Badges] as AlertBadges
    }
}

Optimizer --> RankingRes : Produces Top-K
RankingRes --> Adapter : Consumed Read-Only
SimRes --> Adapter : Supplies lap_dataframe (FL/FR/RL/RR wear)

SessionState --> ViewPrep : Passes scenario_id
Adapter --> ViewPrep : Supplies lap_dataframe & stint_dataframe

ViewPrep --> FuelHeader : Render Burn Rate & Margin
ViewPrep --> CornerWearChart : Render 4-Wheel Degradation
ViewPrep --> WearBalanceVisual : Render Front/Rear & Left/Right Bias
ViewPrep --> TireLifeTable : Render Deg Rate & Remaining Life
ViewPrep --> AlertBadges : Render Engineering Threshold Alerts

note right of ViewPrep
  **READ-ONLY PRESENTATION**
  * NO Monte Carlo Analysis
  * NO Sensitivity Analysis
  * NO Re-ranking / Scoring
  * NO Simulation Rerun
  * NO Constraint Re-validation
  * NO Optimization
  * NO ML / LLM
end note

@enduml
